  m_text: "Ye\u015Filtepe Golf Kul\xFCb\xFC'n\xFCn <b>Alt\u0131n Bayrak Turnuvas\u0131</b>'ndas\u0131n!
    Bu turnuvada sopa yok: dev golf toplar\u0131n\u0131 elinle s\xFCr\xFCp <b>60
    saniye</b> i\xE7inde <b>10 numaral\u0131 deli\u011Fe</b> sokmal\u0131s\u0131n.\n\n<b>W
    A S D / Y\xF6n Tu\u015Flar\u0131:</b>  Y\xFCr\xFC\n<b>Topu it:</b>  Topa do\u011Fru
    y\xFCr\xFC, kollar\u0131nla iterek bayrakl\u0131 deli\u011Fe yuvarla\n<b>Robot
    \xE7im bi\xE7iciler:</b>  Yakla\u015F\u0131nca seni kovalar, \xE7arparsa geri
    itilirsin\n<b>ESC / P:</b>  Duraklat\n\nKorna \xE7almadan 10 topu da deli\u011Fe
    sokarsan <b>Alt\u0131n Bayrak Kupas\u0131</b> senin!"
